# The keys, entries, and bound of the compile cache of host objects
# (D212) and of the entries of GPU modules (D214), and clearing
# (D217), also while another process writes; the cache
# across processes is in compile-cache-*.test. The total of the cache
# (D234, #196): of 300 stores below the bound, one
# lists the directory; after an eviction at the bound, which goes down to
# 90% of it, the 31 stores that fit under the bound list nothing (#675).
# RUN: rm -rf %t
# RUN: mdir-compile-cache-test %t | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: size file: 300 stores, listings 1
# CHECK: after an eviction: 31 stores fit
# CHECK: compile cache checks passed
